# Byte-sensitive. The corpus feeds the determinism gate, the golden graph is the
# regression baseline, and test/fixtures/corpus/docs/windows-notes.md is CRLF on
# purpose (pinned by .gitattributes). Reformatting any of it breaks the gate.
test/fixtures/

# Published frontmatter JSON Schemas are immutable once released — they are
# evolved by adding a new version file, never by editing bytes in place.
schemas/

# Prose is hand-wrapped (CLAUDE.md tables, ADR structure, docs pages) and
# CHANGELOG.md is generated by semantic-release. Prettier's markdown reflow adds
# churn without adding signal. `*.md` does not cover `.mdx`, so name both.
*.md
*.mdx

# The docs site is its own npm project with its own generated output.
docs/node_modules/
docs/dist/
docs/.astro/
